#NEXUS

[ pretto2018a_fig11: Early dinosauriform strict consensus, panel A, read from 3x crops and the close nodes at 8x. Four nodes are multi-way: Saltopus/Lewisuchus/Pseudolagosuchus with the rest; the Diodorus-Silesaurus-Sacisaurus node; the Scutellosaurus node (entered at Eocursor's height); and Petrified forest teropod, Dilophosaurus and the coelophysid clade, which leave one vertical below Dilophosaurus. No clade names are printed; the numbers are bootstrap and Bremer values. 44 tips, 4 polytomies (4, 3, 4, 3 children). Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

